    {
      "flavor_text": "GIRAFARIG’s rear head also has a brain,\nbut it is small. The rear head attacks in\nresponse to smells and sounds.\fApproaching this POKéMON from behind\ncan cause the rear head to suddenly\nlash out and bite.",
